# Optional. make kind-bootstrap does not load this file.
#
# Default mode mirrors the working tree into an in-cluster git server so
# Argo CD can sync while this repository is private. Committed Application
# manifests keep the GitHub URL and targetRevision main.
#
# GITOPS_MODE=local
#
# After the repository is public and main contains these charts, you can
# set GITOPS_MODE=github. If the GitHub repository is still private, export
# GITHUB_TOKEN in your shell for that run. Do not commit a token.
# The Grafana and Argo CD admin passwords are never stored here. Grafana's
# password is generated into a Kubernetes secret. Argo CD's initial admin
# password is read from argocd-initial-admin-secret.
